commit 3725bfcc8c8e66204a7ae76ff9ff14cc4ea8368d (parent 1314b4bcb9ed7967c4cc7773790e60c6f0c316fc)

Experiment: the witness says what it refused, and the test kernels build

Not for landing. `stop-budget-spent` is read so a kernel with actuators
builds, and the mask-windows witness logs the transition it refused before
its panic, which a CPU already inside a page fault reports without it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>


